            "name": "Customer",
            "description": "- **Type:** `ThirdParty`\n- **Icon:** `fa fa-user`\n\nMailChimp Subscriber\n\n### Configuration\n\n| Action | Allowed | Push | Pull |\n|--------|:-------:|:----:|:----:|\n| Create | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 |\n| Update | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 |\n| Delete | \u2705 | \u2705 | \u2705 |\n\n<SchemaDefinition schemaRef=\"#/components/schemas/ThirdParty\" />"
        }
